  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A shard of ice streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 cold damage.</p><p>The spell creates more than one shard when you reach higher levels: two shards at 5th level, three shards at 11th level, and four shards at 17th level. You can direct the shards at the same target or at different ones. Make a separate attack roll for each shard.</p>",
